---
import Tag from "./Tag.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import naosi from "../assets/naosi.svg";
---

<footer class="mt-12 border-t-4 border-primary bg-[#1c2b1a] text-white">
  <div
    class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl grid-cols-1 gap-10 px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 md:grid-cols-[1.4fr_0.7fr_1fr] lg:px-8"
  >
    <div>
      <Image width={104} src={naosi} alt="NAOSI" />
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-white/70">
        大连理工大学网络与开源协会成立于 2021
        年，是一个由大连理工大学学生自发组成的开源爱好者组织。我们奉行开源与奉献的协会精神，以项目和热爱为基础，致力于推动开源文化的发展。
      </p>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="页脚导航">
      <p class="mt-0 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary-light">探索</p>
      <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col items-start gap-3 text-sm">
        <a class="text-white/70 decoration-none hover:text-white" href="/#services">校园服务</a>
        <a class="text-white/70 decoration-none hover:text-white" href="/events">近期活动</a>
        <a class="text-white/70 decoration-none hover:text-white" href="/blog">社团博客</a>
        <a class="text-white/70 decoration-none hover:text-white" href="/feed.xml">RSS 订阅</a>
      </div>
    </nav>
    <div>
      <p class="mt-0 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary-light">联系我们</p>
      <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <Tag href="https://github.com/NAOSI-DLUT">
          <span class="i-ri-github-fill"></span>
          <span>GitHub</span>
        </Tag>
        <Tag href="https://qm.qq.com/q/AxAh9JeZs4">
          <span class="i-ri-qq-fill"></span>
          <span>724021138</span>
        </Tag>
        <Tag href="https://space.bilibili.com/1058346981">
          <span class="i-ri-bilibili-fill"></span>
          <span>NAOSI-DLUT</span>
        </Tag>
        <Tag href="mailto:support@naosi.org">
          <span class="i-ri-mail-fill"></span>
          <span>support@naosi.org</span>
        </Tag>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="border-t border-white/10">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-wrap justify-between gap-2 px-4 py-5 text-xs text-white/40 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} NAOSI · DLUT</span>
      <span>OPEN SOURCE · OPEN MIND</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
